pdated_at":"2025-08-01T12:16:55Z","body":"Compilation of the GDScript.\n\nThe error occurs when the GDScript is loaded and compiled. This can be confirmed by the following:\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node\n\nfunc _ready():\n\tprint(\"loading...\")\n\tvar x = load(\"res://gd_script.gd\")\n\tprint(\"loaded\")\n\tadd_child(x.new())\n```\n\nIf I change the scene to use an instanced node of this, \"loading...\" is visible in the Output, but \"loaded\" is not. This indicates the error occured when the script resource was loaded into x. When script resources are loaded, they are compiled AFAIK.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3144386987/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3144392055","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109189#issuecomment-3144392055","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109189","id":3144392055,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67a513","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github